# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Never prefix secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Next.js sets NODE_ENV for dev, build, and start; leave it unset normally.

# Live questions on /lab ("Ask a question"). Without a key, live questions are turned off and the demo still works.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional. The planner model; defaults to gpt-5.6-luna (the cheapest tier, about USD 0.001 per question).
# MORPH_PLANNER_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna
# Optional. Researchers search the web first (OpenAI's built-in search, about 1 cent per search, so a
# question costs about 5–7 cents). Set to off to use the model's general knowledge only.
# MORPH_WEB_SEARCH=on
